stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Idea : project created
  Idea --> Hypothesis : admin · 1+ idea contribution
  Hypothesis --> Funding : admin · hypothesis committed
  Hypothesis --> Experiments : funding not enabled (skip)
  Funding --> Experiments : grant funded, or admin override with reason
  Experiments --> Data : 1+ protocol published and 1+ verified submission
  Data --> Published : admin · manuscript ready, snapshots frozen, credits settled
  Published --> [*]
